  characterName: Oz
  description: 'You see a guy working on his laptop at the back left of the space.
    He seems to be listening to Black Sabbath which you can hear leaking through
    his cheap earphones. '
  characterType: 1
  portrait: {fileID: -4189176185643718361, guid: 6455cac23c1781c488ec5f7115c14ff8, type: 3}
  hasBeenMet: 0
  ambientLines:
  - speakerName: Oz
    text: '"The seven hundreth unicorn is waiting in the sky"'
  - speakerName: Oz
    text: '"A symptom of the universe, a love that never dies"'
  - speakerName: Oz
    text: '"I don''t know whats happening, my heads all torn inside"'
  - speakerName: Oz
    text: '"Peaople say I''m heavy, they don''t know what I hide"'
